%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_07_LegalCompliance
  questionId: COMM-07
  category: 2
  speakerName: Sales Director
  questionText: >-
    Legal raises compliance concerns late in the cycle and Sales says they are slowing everything down. How do you respond in the panel?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_07_A1
  answerText: >-
    Treat legal as a buying stakeholder, identify the specific control concern, and build it into the close plan.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_07_A2
  answerText: >-
    Explain the standard compliance packet and push to keep the technical win moving.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_07_A3
  answerText: >-
    Admit legal may find a real blocker, then propose a short architecture-and-contract review before next steps.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -2
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_07_A4
  answerText: >-
    Suggest legal usually comes around once security signs off, and keep the meeting focused on value.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: 0
